    <item>
      <title>以开源模型挑战美国霸主地位，英国政府斥资 6000 万英镑建 AI 实验室</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2465411</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2465411</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jun 2026 07:14:01 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;英国政府今天宣布拨款 6000 万英镑（现汇率约合 5.39 亿元人民币），为牛津大学、伦敦大学学院（UCL）建立两座 AI 实验室。旨在开发低硬件需求的开源 AI 模型，减少依赖美国大型科技公司产品。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/b/a/0ba962ce312a0b08ceeba574e4e45a5633f58d71.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/1Fa9UITA4mAyWkbtJcOf4H9gWyt.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;17822851878486567842261572314718&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba962ce312a0b08ceeba574e4e45a5633f58d71_2_453x499.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;17822851878486567842261572314718&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;1Fa9UITA4mAyWkbtJcOf4H9gWyt&quot; width=&quot;453&quot; height=&quot;499&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba962ce312a0b08ceeba574e4e45a5633f58d71_2_453x499.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba962ce312a0b08ceeba574e4e45a5633f58d71_2_679x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/b/a/0ba962ce312a0b08ceeba574e4e45a5633f58d71_2_906x998.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;D9DEE2&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;据悉，牛津大学、UCL 将共同参与该项目，共同设计 AI 基础数学理论、改进 AI 模型架构、开发低算力需求的 AI 系统，与美国等国家普遍采用的闭源、高算力方案形成鲜明对比。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;英国 AI 事务部长 Kanishka Narayan 指出，新实验室将让 AI 变得更便宜、更容易部署、更实用，让更多企业和公共服务都能接入 AI，确保英国处于领先地位。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;此外，两所大学还将拨款 200 万英镑(即约合 1795.8 万元人民币)培养博士生，并至少招聘 10 名研究人员，扩大 AI 人才库储备。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;aside class=&quot;onebox allowlistedgeneric&quot; data-onebox-src=&quot;https://www.ithome.com/0/967/628.htm&quot;&gt;
  &lt;header class=&quot;source&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/4/f/b/4fbb2870cf699a2389c9964ba5400d080ce7a0bd.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;DC5353&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot;&gt;

      &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ithome.com/0/967/628.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;ithome.com&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
    

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ithome.com/0/967/628.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;以开源模型挑战美国霸主地位，英国政府斥资 6000 万英镑建 AI 实验室 - IT之家&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;英国政府宣布拨款 6000 万英镑，在牛津大学和伦敦大学学院建立两座 AI 实验室。核心目标是开发对硬件要求低的开源 AI 模型，旨在减少对美国科技巨头的依赖，让 AI 变得更便宜、更易部署。项目还将投入 200 万英镑培养博士生，并招聘至少 10 名研究人员。#英国 AI 实验室# #开源 AI 挑战#&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;onebox-metadata&quot;&gt;
    
    
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div style=&quot;clear: both&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;onebox allowlistedgeneric&quot; data-onebox-src=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-backs-new-ai-labs-to-make-technology-cheaper-more-reliable-and-easier-to-use&quot;&gt;
  &lt;header class=&quot;source&quot;&gt;
      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/d/3/3d3ab4be5a57c5c67701218be6e0768ff3dfc1c6.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;5392C9&quot; width=&quot;48&quot; height=&quot;48&quot;&gt;

      &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-backs-new-ai-labs-to-make-technology-cheaper-more-reliable-and-easier-to-use&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;GOV.UK&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;aspect-image&quot; style=&quot;--aspect-ratio:690/362;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/2/8/1288e935aa2f13c43f6906ced9d75cb9585f9007.png&quot; class=&quot;thumbnail&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;2575BB&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;362&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/news/uk-backs-new-ai-labs-to-make-technology-cheaper-more-reliable-and-easier-to-use&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;UK backs new AI labs to make technology cheaper, more reliable and easier to use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;Oxford and UCL to host new government-backed labs developing the next generation of AI that more businesses and services can readily use&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;onebox-metadata&quot;&gt;
    
    
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div style=&quot;clear: both&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
